{"sha": "667abad049ed545cc1c8932957af5488344b752a315e19b66c0ea00392d73fd1", "body": ["\\section{基本函数的导数}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:g11:deriv:refderivatives}", "在各自的可导定义域上：", "\\[", "(c)' = 0, \\quad", "(x)' = 1, \\quad", "(x^2)' = 2x, \\quad", "(x^3)' = 3x^2, \\quad", "\\left(\\frac1x\\right)' = -\\frac{1}{x^2}, \\quad", "(\\sqrt x\\,)' = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x} \\ (x > 0).", "\\]", "更一般地，$(x^n)' = n\\,x^{n-1}$ 对每个整数 $n \\geq 1$ 成立。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "各证明均沿用\\cref{ex:g11:deriv:atpoint}中的思路：先化简", "变化率，再令 $h \\to 0$。取定定义域中的 $a$。", "", "\\emph{常值函数与恒等函数。}$\\frac{c - c}{h} = 0$ 与", "$\\frac{(a+h) - a}{h} = 1$ 对所有 $h$ 成立，极限分别为 $0$ 与 $1$。", "", "\\emph{平方。}$\\frac{(a+h)^2 - a^2}{h} = \\frac{2ah + h^2}{h} = 2a + h", "\\to 2a$。", "", "\\emph{立方。}$(a+h)^3 = a^3 + 3a^2h + 3ah^2 + h^3$，于是变化率为", "$3a^2 + 3ah + h^2 \\to 3a^2$。", "", "\\emph{倒数。}对 $a \\neq 0$ 及充分小的 $h$，使得", "$a + h \\neq 0$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{h}\\left(\\frac{1}{a+h} - \\frac{1}{a}\\right)", "= \\frac{1}{h} \\cdot \\frac{a - (a+h)}{a(a+h)}", "= \\frac{-1}{a(a+h)}", "\\xrightarrow[h \\to 0]{} -\\frac{1}{a^2}.", "\\]", "", "\\emph{平方根。}对 $a > 0$，乘以共轭式：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\sqrt{a+h} - \\sqrt a}{h}", "= \\frac{(a + h) - a}{h\\,(\\sqrt{a+h} + \\sqrt a)}", "= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a+h} + \\sqrt a}", "\\xrightarrow[h \\to 0]{} \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt a}.", "\\]", "", "\\emph{一般幂。}$2a$、$3a^2$ 所示的规律仍然成立：展开", "$(a+h)^n$ 中，$a^n + n\\,a^{n-1}h$ 之后的各项都含 $h^2$，故变化率", "趋于 $n\\,a^{n-1}$。（完整的归纳法证明在", "\\cref{ch:g12:deriv}中给出。）", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{求导法则}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[运算法则]\\label{thm:g11:deriv:rules}", "设 $u$ 与 $v$ 在 $I$ 上可导，$\\lambda \\in \\R$。则", "$u + v$、$\\lambda u$、$uv$ 在 $I$ 上可导，", "$\\frac{u}{v}$ 在使 $v \\neq 0$ 的点处亦可导，且", "\\[", "(u+v)' = u' + v', \\qquad", "(\\lambda u)' = \\lambda u', \\qquad", "(uv)' = u'v + uv', \\qquad", "\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[前三条法则的证明]", "取定 $a \\in I$，并记 $\\Delta u = u(a+h) - u(a)$，", "$\\Delta v = v(a+h) - v(a)$。", "", "\\emph{和。}$u + v$ 的变化率为", "$\\frac{\\Delta u + \\Delta v}{h} = \\frac{\\Delta u}{h} + \\frac{\\Delta v}{h}", "\\to u'(a) + v'(a)$。", "", "\\emph{数乘。}$\\lambda u$ 的变化率为", "$\\lambda \\frac{\\Delta u}{h} \\to \\lambda u'(a)$。", "", "\\emph{乘积。}加上并减去混合项 $u(a+h)\\,v(a)$：", "\\begin{align*}", "\\frac{u(a+h)v(a+h) - u(a)v(a)}{h}", "&= \\frac{u(a+h)v(a+h) - u(a+h)v(a) + u(a+h)v(a) - u(a)v(a)}{h}\\\\", "&= u(a+h)\\,\\frac{\\Delta v}{h} + v(a)\\,\\frac{\\Delta u}{h}.", "\\end{align*}", "当 $h \\to 0$ 时，$\\frac{\\Delta v}{h} \\to v'(a)$，$\\frac{\\Delta u}{h} \\to", "u'(a)$，且 $u(a+h) \\to u(a)$（其变化率有极限，故", "$\\Delta u = h \\cdot \\frac{\\Delta u}{h} \\to 0$）。于是变化率趋于", "$u(a)v'(a) + v(a)u'(a)$。", "", "商的求导法则同理可证；它\\emph{在本阶段", "不加证明地承认}，并在\\cref{ch:g12:deriv}中证明。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:deriv:computations}", "\\emph{多项式。}$f(x) = 3x^3 - 5x^2 + 7x - 2$：", "\\[", "f'(x) = 3 \\times 3x^2 - 5 \\times 2x + 7 = 9x^2 - 10x + 7 .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{商。}$g(x) = \\frac{2x+1}{x^2+1}$：其中 $u = 2x + 1$，$v = x^2", "+ 1$，", "\\[", "g'(x) = \\frac{2(x^2+1) - (2x+1)\\,2x}{(x^2+1)^2}", "= \\frac{-2x^2 - 2x + 2}{(x^2+1)^2}.", "\\]", "", "\\emph{乘积。}$k(x) = x\\sqrt x$，当 $x > 0$ 时：", "$k'(x) = 1 \\times \\sqrt x + x \\times \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}", "= \\sqrt x + \\frac{\\sqrt x}{2} = \\frac{3\\sqrt x}{2}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{导数的符号与单调性}", ""]}